  <item>
    <title>14. “前“留子们一路上的荆棘与鲜花</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a9d89d247d51713cca3d4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a9d89d247d51713cca3d4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 10:52:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span>圣诞节之前，有两位加拿大留学的好朋友jingfei和大强一起录制这一期播客。尽管远在大洋彼端，但是可以依旧线上畅聊。因为录制时长太长，分成了上下两期，希望能和大家一起分享。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>注意：因为大家聊的太嗨，而且第一次线上没经验，所以有很多杂音（我尽力了，但是消除不了，事后已对当事人做出批评教育）。</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>留学回忆杀</span></strong><span>：滑雪翻车、摩根大通小哥的轻音乐惊魂</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>容貌焦虑自救指南</span></strong><span>：卡诗防脱发精华实测，男生精致护肤有多卷？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>逆袭故事</span></strong><span>：从初中霸凌到博士，成绩垫底如何逆袭成“别人家的孩子”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>始祖鸟玄学</span></strong><span>：安踏收购背后的代购江湖，加拿大抢购攻略大揭秘</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>雅思血泪史</span></strong><span>：语法天才的口语社死现场，国内英语教育的痛谁懂？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a></span></code><span> 开场：加拿大留学三人组登场，八卦之夜启动</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a></span></code><span> 摩根大通小哥的“翻车”滑雪惊魂</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a></span></code><span> 2016年滑雪老照片回忆杀，年轻真好！</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a></span></code><span> 安踏收购始祖鸟，国牌逆袭震惊全场</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a></span></code><span> 防脱发大战：卡诗黑瓶洗发膏实测，发缝拯救计划</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a></span></code><span> 精致男孩从迪奥到欧舒丹的消费升级（咱就是想上升一下“高度”，但是被无情打击）</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a></span></code><span> 初中霸凌回忆：成绩垫底、同桌女生与座位歧视</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a></span></code><span> 留学选择：2+2项目的真相</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a></span></code><span> 雅思血泪史：语法满分，口语却差点“拔地而起”</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a></span></code><span> 逆袭结局：从天坑专业到博士的华丽转身</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎留言：kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
