  <item>
    <title>13. 旷野与轨道，驰骋与蹈矩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67471f7d11045e78e56f201f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67471f7d11045e78e56f201f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 13:37:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>人生是旷野，不是轨道</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>今天我们从北京初雪等雪说起，谈到相识相聚相遇，聊到做事初心，学着调整内心的秩序，享受一切可能性，接受一切结果，生活不止一种解法。旷野般的人生，请尽情驰骋！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 北京，初雪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 一时兴起，大摆锤的无穷快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 加拿大Wonderland，过山车。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 《王子猷雪夜访戴》，目的与过程孰轻孰重？潇洒一些。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 《记承天寺夜游》，怀民亦未寝。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 花儿与少年-丝路季，快乐合拍的人很重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 《湖心亭看雪》，</span><strong><span>殊途同归可能是最大最大的一种善意。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 哈利·波特，露娜，所有我们失去的东西最后都会以意想不到的方式回到身边。The things we lose have a way of coming back to us in the end, if not always in the way we expect.。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>BGM：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Merry Christmas - Ed Sheeran, Elton John</span></p><span></span><p><span>月亮船 - 王英姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>锁麟囊（伦敦酒吧版）- 毓贞在伦敦</span></p><span></span><p><span>给你一瓶魔法药水 - 告五人</span></p><span></span><p><span>花儿与少年 - 秦海璐; 秦岚; 辛芷蕾; 迪丽热巴; 赵昭仪; 王安宇; 胡先煦</span></p><span></span><p><span>初雪 - EXO</span></p><span></span><p><span>Harry Potter 电影配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>No fear in my heart - 朴树</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎留言：kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
