  <item>
    <title>10. 你发疯吗？焦虑吗？瞎操心吗？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672e1c9343dc3a43871a5026</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672e1c9343dc3a43871a5026</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Nov 2024 14:17:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>Show notes</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>琐碎而黏糊的生活总是给我们的内心带来很多窸窸窣窣的嘈杂，当一切从量变产生质变，可能后果是不可想象的。所以，我们今天有三个主要问题要去讨论，是稳定发疯还是持续内耗？面对压力，逃避焦虑是可耻的吗？共情太强，操心太多，究竟是好是坏？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天参与线上录制的嘉宾是返场的马教授和新加入的朋友黄总（黄总的手机没放好，所以音质较差，多多见谅），希望收听播客的你可以开心快乐幸福！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> MBTI测试结果的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 生活中的不确定性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 我们遇到的那些情绪稳定的“神人”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 负责样品测试的小哥哥</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 快递驿站的小姐姐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 打印店的老板娘</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 小黄就是一直情绪稳定</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 情绪稳定且上进的Shang哥</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 精神内耗与焦虑，如何去解决非必要的内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> “逃避”焦虑带来的“羞耻感”是对的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 小学课文《小马过河》：过度的情绪内耗可能会导致失去行动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">37:47</a> 《实习医生格蕾》：共情力太强，是一件有益的事情嘛？</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Some spots</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 以己度人会带来认知偏差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 亲密关系中的情绪稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> 情绪互助会成立了，哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 正视正常的思考，区别精神内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 小马的ending</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>Monday - 窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><span>又见他 - TieYann 鐵陽</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我出海了，请留言：kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
