  <item>
    <title>6. 你就是你自己的牧羊人（可可托海，乌鲁木齐）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c1d7d633591c27beef3b88</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c1d7d633591c27beef3b88</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Aug 2024 11:15:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新疆旅行最后一段行程，可可托海，“自建国以来就被列为国家高度机密的区域”、“世界最大矿坑”、“代号111”、“两弹一星的来源”、“中国第二冷极”、中国的“落基山国家公园”、拥有世界最完好的地震断裂带、“世界地质矿产博物馆”，“宝石之乡”…所有这些看起来充满传奇色彩的关键词，都属于这个神秘的地方一可可托海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这一期的《课间活动》能把阿勒泰的风希望吹向你，也希望你开心快乐。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 《我的阿勒泰》，张凤侠。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 《我的阿勒泰》，托肯。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> &nbsp;职场女性的困境，与电视剧截然相反。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> &nbsp;反思与自省，希望每个人都值得被看见，收到鲜花与尊重。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> &nbsp;出发去可可托海。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> &nbsp;奇观：相濡以沫的”夫妻树“。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo-X2p_bxVw0vLoTZOPKK-SV5ECL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> &nbsp;额尔吉斯河水与石，神钟山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpu-jIp_8LhCv5DmDizEmqjWrVp3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltWRLU04ao-Lp5Crki4J6xttKX3L.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lip1IP6khQU0G7FIw6IujhOtA0GV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> &nbsp;瀑布沟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loLeHSpjk2CEHQdGJyHHJvfzBVLs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> &nbsp;小钟山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnO-ByZavoiaF1jvG8WoW8krWzOu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 神鹰峰，游客服务中心，喀拉卓勒瀑布</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lod6wcXESicHpgz4J8aM4WNaGftk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGia8KueTnJILCYwjto_-U9qin_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llI23LcfQug6jIEoB4MJfNrOYpmh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 乌鲁木齐，大巴扎，手抓。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvwm0ZlViwQ55NE2UABVixrMSfEE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh0eloGAYsRk6paHDIDLTmLozDeK.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>Some spots</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 徒步路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 合理安排路线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMkA3-mBsaCEeLBC2k4QhJi7lCf.jpg"></figure><span></span><h1><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span>《我的阿勒泰》OST：</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴太与小马</span></p><span></span><p><span>白色的波浪</span></p><span></span><p><span>草原的风</span></p><span></span><p><span>李文秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>那仁夏牧场</span></p><span></span><p><span>人间天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span>心动</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿勒泰 - 叶尔波利</span></p><span></span><p><span>可可托海的牧羊 - 王琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听《课间活动》。黑板留言：kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
