  <item>
    <title>5. 世界如此安静，吾愿吾亦如是（新疆布尔津县，富蕴县）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672b075c26e396a36ea1116</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672b075c26e396a36ea1116</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 10:18:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>生活啊生活，总是有一些鸡毛蒜皮，总是让你辨不明看不清。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>（一点点说明：旅行时间是2021年10月，录制时间是2022年7月，口罩期间）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 疫情下的生活与内心世界，费劲心力去填满生活的空隙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 自由自在的状态，建立生活的秩序感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 《向往的生活》刘昊然+彭昱畅，陆地冲浪板带来的三分钟的热度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 继续讲讲新疆的旅行，布尔津县出发的公路旅行</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjqdQqs2Po_6MqwHxz-bBgcjCaqe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 戈壁辽阔，晴空白日 偶遇的羊群 骆驼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtkOUFypCt6kBjWy4nw7BsmPYVyL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgvk02JcKdad51QrPxmNa97W3AWl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 遇的湖泊/河流，防护林，国境线自驾上的奇妙体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 公路旅行产生对生活的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 达到富蕴县，穿城而过的河流</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-22_IRpzwYR8ao5WylliALCEo_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfKagi-piv7bg4r9NqPzb2Mv6Tc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 现代人造景观，无法逃离 （是否能看到那个五彩信号塔，哈哈哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBM4WwWjcgnEUFbK_wx2ntzbo9M.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsAb9E0ZRVfPgJkdEMskJJf2kWR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 新疆美食，强烈安利馕坑肉！！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUd8p0zPrVFmDm4PRSPZCLxES4W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 河滨公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikncNSrx6Xu2PZV8BFyrLY3feS0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUnjXSFbslwVqvrpXanHqgNW7kL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 广场舞走起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 生活啊生活，爱自己，爱生活。 大可不必扭扭捏捏，想做就去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾彩蛋： <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 录的一段广场舞音乐，现代流行音乐vs民族音乐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>BGM：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Koko - 坂本龙一</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听《课间活动》。黑板留言：kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
