  <item>
    <title>4. 山峦之间的深渊是否早已看淡喀纳斯的风雪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6655d51c790e136fcb4b1c48</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6655d51c790e136fcb4b1c48</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 May 2024 12:59:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【2021年国庆节】风雨兼程的路途，一波未平一波又起。那些始料未及的、那些差强人意和那些平淡无奇的，都是我们乐此不疲的寻常的日子。平静的湖面下，是否有神奇的未知的湖怪，山峦之间的深渊是否早已看淡风雪，且听且行。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 禾木村的热气球惊喜&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 喀纳斯景区介绍，门票，区间车&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 伊犁州突发疫情&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 前往喀纳斯的换乘中心，路过三湾一湖&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 准备去观鱼台&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 排队买观鱼台的区间车&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 边防证办理tips&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 正式登山去观鱼台&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> 爬山，期待喀纳斯水怪&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 到达观鱼台，俯瞰喀纳斯湖，村落，很像哈利波特与火焰杯的结尾的场景&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 下山路上&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 开始排长队等车，准备回换乘中心&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 又开始排队，办边防证，（排队插队的人吵架）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 到达景区大门，回酒店取车，去吃饭，车钥匙没电，饭馆爆满，囧事太多&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 继续囧，酒店停电了，暖气没了，马桶堵了，人都快心态爆炸了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 第二天一早的彩蛋&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 对比下一下稻城亚丁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 运力不足的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 旅行与治愈的小思考，顺带预告下稻城亚丁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a> tips ：办边防证，一定要保存好所有证件，票据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 新疆自驾加油需要注意的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位同学在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，荔枝，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听。 欢迎唠唠： kejianhuodong@outlook.com&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lghWrXjsP-CvW5dAC8yYqvrgxZ9N.m4a" length="51933517" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhwPKTPxKQXuzq3iJv27wKYmyUaK.png"/>
