  <item>
    <title>3. 神的自留地，禾木村</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664b4b6b82b428eafddaa2d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664b4b6b82b428eafddaa2d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 May 2024 13:08:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在李娟的《我的阿勒泰》里面夏日的那仁牧场让人心情舒畅，而阿勒泰初冬的天气总是变幻莫测，我想它的魅力在于它的美好和恬淡。在布尔津县的禾木村，作为神的自留地，可以窥见图瓦族人的生活，可以俯瞰晨雾蔼蔼，还可以山顶等候日出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：当然也可能不只是晨雾，可能还有飞雪，哈哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 收到新疆寄的明信片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 喀纳斯-禾木，Y型岔路口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 村头超市，遇到的有意思的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 正式进村，小白狗，小猫，小黑狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 住宿问题，主要是穷，住不起，哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 禾木河，禾木桥，上山，观景台，美丽峰，延时摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 下山，吃牛肉面，点心店，书屋，找厕所。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 爬山，看日出</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些些图片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmpbpIWZ_ehUlZ2YC7SOlXz_Cpc1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-村舍-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgBQMQkHCelt6-Y9IO4mvJau7Lz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-俯瞰秋日禾木村-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljduaOSHGn1VGF-7JdUoiRG1mheA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-禾木村的日出-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>月光 - 于适 《我的阿勒泰》</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位朋友在小宇宙，网易云音乐，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐，Apple Podcast，Spotify等平台订阅收听。欢迎留言： kejianhuodong@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
